// the glossary's first mentions on a page (details() in ddes.html), in English: [term as written in English, definition]
EN.GLOSS = [['NSR-10', "Colombia's seismic-resistant building code (Reglamento Colombiano de Construcción Sismo Resistente), in force since 2010."], ['Law 1796', 'Safe Housing Law (2016): independent design review and technical supervision.'], ['Certificado Técnico de Ocupación', 'Signed by the technical supervisor when construction ends. Without it, the building cannot be occupied.'], ['curaduría', 'The office that reviews applications and issues building permits.'], ['f′c', 'Specified compressive strength of the concrete in the design, measured at 28 days.'], ['ETABS', 'Structural analysis software for buildings.'], ['LOD', 'Level of detail of a BIM model.']];
